    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Alpha Wolf's initial specification called for a blend of the Warwolf and Timber Wolf in an assault 'Mech package, with the Wulfen's stealth armor. It shares electronics packages with the Wulfen and Warwolf —amongst others— more as a means to streamline development than for any advanced abilities of the systems themselves. Applying the Wulfen's stealth   armor onto an assault 'Mech raised eyebrows initially, although this decision hinged not on a desire for the Alpha Wolf to fill roles traditionally associated with stealth, such as scouting and infiltration. Rather, the benefits that stealth armor offered in disrupting enemy targeting systems cemented the selection, as it would allow the Alpha Wolf to survive longer in standup fights.",
